Flow has added a new 360p option for Gemini Omni Flash, making it more cost-effective to iterate on your ideas.
• Available everywhere: Use 360p Omni across all user tiers, durations, and generation modes.
• Stretch your credits: At 1⁄2 the credit cost of 720p Omni, it is perfect for rapid storyboarding and fast prompt iterations.
• Upscale when ready: Users on paid tiers can seamlessly upgrade their favorite clips using our new 360p to 720p upscaler.
We have also added the 'First Frame, Last Frame' capability to Omni Frames-to-Video across all durations and resolutions.
Happy generating!
